1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,629
This is StreetdocMD.

2
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:05,750
Verified doctors, nurses and physiotherapists who come to you.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:10,664
One platform connects patients with clinicians, labs, pharmacies and hospitals.

4
00:00:10,714 --> 00:00:13,150
Let's follow one visit from start to finish.

5
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:17,265
Meet Tolu. She lives in Bodija, Ibadan, and has had headaches all week.

6
00:00:17,315 --> 00:00:21,550
Her blood pressure readings at home are high, so she wants a doctor to come to her.

7
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,654
Tolu creates her account on the patient app.

8
00:00:25,704 --> 00:00:32,213
Then she adds her medical profile: allergies, conditions and current medicines.

9
00:00:32,263 --> 00:00:35,950
Every clinician sees this before they arrive.

10
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:40,208
Dr Tobenna Eze is a verified cardiologist on StreetdocMD.

11
00:00:40,258 --> 00:00:44,350
He sets his rates, then switches on to receive visit requests.

12
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,365
Tolu books Dr Tobenna directly with his provider code.

13
00:00:48,415 --> 00:00:52,789
She chooses a visit now, confirms her address and checks the price.

14
00:00:52,839 --> 00:00:56,750
She can pay by card, bank transfer or USSD through Paystack.

15
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:01,507
Once Paystack confirms the payment, the request goes straight to Dr Tobenna.

16
00:01:01,557 --> 00:01:03,150
He has two minutes to accept.

17
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:09,423
The request shows the reason for the visit, allergies, distance and his payout.

18
00:01:09,473 --> 00:01:13,550
He accepts, heads out, and updates each step as he goes.

19
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:17,571
Tolu follows him on a live map, with an arrival time.

20
00:01:17,621 --> 00:01:21,950
She can see each step, and call him from the app if she needs to.

21
00:01:22,450 --> 00:01:26,608
At Tolu's home, Dr Tobenna records the visit in a guided clinical note.

22
00:01:26,658 --> 00:01:30,164
Her profile, conditions and allergies are already filled in.

23
00:01:30,214 --> 00:01:35,142
Her blood pressure is 162 over 104, and values outside the normal range are flagged.

24
00:01:35,192 --> 00:01:38,283
He records a coded diagnosis: essential hypertension.

25
00:01:38,333 --> 00:01:43,616
He increases her Amlodipine and orders a lipid profile and electrolytes from a nearby lab.

26
00:01:43,666 --> 00:01:47,350
Submitting the note completes the visit and credits his payout.

27
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:50,502
Tolu's app shows her what to do next.

28
00:01:50,552 --> 00:01:54,738
She sends her prescription to a partner pharmacy near her.

29
00:01:54,788 --> 00:02:01,750
She checks the lab tests, the lab, the price and a home collection time, then approves and pays.

30
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:06,861
Mokola Family Pharmacy receives the prescription and prices it.

31
00:02:06,911 --> 00:02:13,150
Once Tolu has paid, they dispense it, send it out with a rider and mark it delivered.

32
00:02:13,650 --> 00:02:17,917
Clearpath Diagnostics accepts the order and books a home collection.

33
00:02:17,967 --> 00:02:21,852
Their collector confirms Tolu's identity and takes the sample.

34
00:02:21,902 --> 00:02:26,550
Results go in with reference ranges and flags, and are sent to the doctor.

35
00:02:27,050 --> 00:02:32,377
Dr Tobenna reviews the results before Tolu sees them, and explains what they mean.

36
00:02:32,427 --> 00:02:37,950
In the care journey chat, the doctor, lab and pharmacy see every update in one place.

37
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:43,200
Tolu gets her results with Dr Tobenna's notes and the next step.

38
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:46,350
Her whole care journey stays in one place.

39
00:02:46,850 --> 00:02:50,730
Behind the scenes, the StreetdocMD team checks every provider and facility before they go live,

40
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:53,750
and oversees payments, payouts, safeguarding and medical report requests.

41
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:58,100
Book, visit, prescribe, deliver, test and follow up.

42
00:02:58,150 --> 00:03:02,150
One connected journey, from the first tap to recovery.

43
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:05,915
StreetdocMD. Healthcare, closer to you.

44
00:03:05,965 --> 00:03:08,550
Book a visit at streetdocmd.com
